# Curi TDD

Follow `docs/TDD.md`.

1. Write failing test describing behaviour (domain, API, or component).
2. Implement minimum code to pass.
3. Refactor; keep green.

Mock Perplexity and Supabase in unit tests. Every bugfix adds a regression test. PR must pass `pnpm test`.

Domain priorities: streak, due/done today, plan limits, clarify depth bands, idempotent quiz completion.
